This is a placeholder.

The real "ffmpeg" binary is not checked into this repository (see .gitignore)
and needs to be added before building - see the README's
"Building from Source" section for exact steps:

  1. Download the macOS build (filename contains "macos") from
     https://github.com/yt-dlp/FFmpeg-Builds/releases/latest
  2. Extract the archive - the "ffmpeg" binary is inside, usually under bin/
  3. Rename/move it so you have a plain file named exactly "ffmpeg"
  4. chmod +x ffmpeg
  5. Drag it into the "Youtube X" group in Xcode, replacing this file,
     with "Copy items if needed" checked and the Youtube X target selected.
